{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-frobenius-geometric-role","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:frobenius-geometric-role","kind":"remark","title":"Frobenius structure as categorical integration","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-frobenius-pairing"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-frobenius-pairing","tags":["frobenius","integration","pedagogy"],"text":"frobenius-geometric-role.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:frobenius-geometric-role\"></a><p>The Frobenius structure on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> provides <em>integration</em> in the categorical calculus. The quantum universe pairs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Differentiation</strong>: the Kähler differentials <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Omega^1(A)</code> measure infinitesimal change within <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Integration</strong>: the Frobenius form <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A \\colon A \\to \\mathbf{1}</code> assigns a scalar to each element of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Non-degeneracy of the <a href=\"#def:frobenius-pairing\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/quantum-universe\">Frobenius pairing</a> means the measure is faithful: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_A ab = 0</code> for all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">b</code> implies <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a = 0</code>. Differentiation and integration are therefore both internal to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/frobenius-geometric-role.md","heading":"Remark","number":"3.4.3","page":"b/rem-frobenius-geometric-role","qa":{"counts":{"pass":60,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":50},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}}}
